Here are the code changes to allow large painting frames to be both crafted and bought.

### 1. Add the Crafting Recipe

In `code/modules/crafting/recipes.dm` (alongside `/datum/crafting_recipe/painting_frame`):

```dm
/datum/crafting_recipe/painting_frame_large
	name = "Large Painting Frame"
	result = /obj/item/wallframe/painting/large
	time = 2 SECONDS
	reqs = list(
		/obj/item/stack/sheet/mineral/wood = 3,
	)
	category = CAT_ART
```

---

### 2. Add Large Painting Frames to Cargo

In `code/modules/cargo/packs/service.dm`:

Update the Art Supplies Crate so it includes large painting frames for the large canvases included in the pack, and add a dedicated Painting Frames crate:

```dm
/datum/supply_pack/service/art
	name = "Art Supplies Crate"
	desc = "Contains canvases, painting frames, an easel and a palette."
	cost = 1500
	access = ACCESS_LIBRARY
	contains = list(
		/obj/structure/easel,
		/obj/item/canvas/nineteen_nineteen,
		/obj/item/canvas/nineteen_nineteen,
		/obj/item/canvas/twenty_three_nineteen,
		/obj/item/canvas/twenty_three_twenty_three,
		/obj/item/wallframe/painting,
		/obj/item/wallframe/painting,
		/obj/item/wallframe/painting/large,
		/obj/item/wallframe/painting/large,
		/obj/item/paint_palette,
	)
	crate_name = "art supplies crate"

/datum/supply_pack/service/painting_frames
	name = "Painting Frames Crate"
	desc = "Contains two standard painting frames and two large painting frames."
	cost = 1000
	access = ACCESS_LIBRARY
	contains = list(
		/obj/item/wallframe/painting,
		/obj/item/wallframe/painting,
		/obj/item/wallframe/painting/large,
		/obj/item/wallframe/painting/large,
	)
	crate_name = "painting frames crate"
```

---

### 3. Ensure the Item and Structure Definitions are Present

In `code/modules/art/paintings.dm` (if not already defined):

```dm
/obj/item/wallframe/painting/large
	name = "large painting frame"
	desc = "The frame for a large painting, to be mounted on a wall."
	icon_state = "frame-large-empty"
	result_path = /obj/structure/sign/painting/large
	custom_materials = list(/datum/material/wood = SHEET_MATERIAL_AMOUNT * 3)

/obj/structure/sign/painting/large
	name = "large painting"
	desc = "A framed painting."
	icon_state = "frame-large-empty"
	build_path = /obj/item/wallframe/painting/large
	canvas_size = 23
```